insert into episodes (id, title, status, data) values ('episode1', 'Choisis-moi — Épisode 1', 'published', $json${"id":"episode1","title":"Choisis-moi — Épisode 1","university":"Université Aster","start":"s1_1","gaugeSummary":{"leonie":["amitie"],"liam":["amitie","amour"]},"nodes":{"s1_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","background":"assets/Décors/Chambre chez les parents.png","text":"Ça y est…\nC'est la fin des vacances.\nPendant des années, j'avais hâte de devenir étudiante, d'avoir enfin mon indépendance…\nEt maintenant que j'y suis, étrangement, j'ai envie de remonter le temps au lycée.\nC'est drôle, on veut toujours que le temps passe plus vite, et ensuite on se surprend à vouloir revenir en arrière…","next":"s1_2"},"s1_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"{playerName}, ça y est, tu es prête ?\nOn va devoir y aller, on a 2h de route d'ici à ton nouveau campus.","next":"s1_3"},"s1_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui maman.\nMes bagages sont prêts !\nJe n'ai plus qu'à me préparer.\nVoyons voir… Quelle tenue ? Quel look ?","next":"s1_4"},"s1_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Le joueur choisit une tenue et personnalise son avatar : couleur de cheveux, couleur des yeux, couleur des lèvres. — La garde-robe complète sera disponible en Phase 3.)","next":"s1_5"},"s1_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Voilà, parfait.\nAlors c'est parti… vie étudiante, me voilà !","next":"s1_6"},"s1_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(J'ai chargé tous mes cartons et ma valise dans la voiture avec mes parents, et nous sommes partis tous les 3 en direction du campus.)","next":"s2_1"},"s2_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","background":"assets/Décors/Voiture (scène 2).png","text":"(Raaah… Pourquoi les trajets sont toujours plus longs quand on appréhende quelque chose ?)","next":"s2_2"},"s2_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Alors, tu te sens comment ? Tu stresses ? Tu as hâte ?","next":"s2_3"},"s2_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Un peu des deux je crois…\nDites, je peux encore changer d'avis ?","next":"s2_4"},"s2_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"pere","text":"(Il a lâché un petit rire)\nC'est un peu tard pour ça je crois…","next":"s2_5"},"s2_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Tu sais si des amis à toi ont été admis dans ta fac ?","next":"s2_6"},"s2_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Non, je crois que je suis toute seule…","next":"s2_7"},"s2_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Tu vas voir, ça va aller. C'est l'occasion de faire plein de nouvelles rencontres !","next":"s2_8"},"s2_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"De toute façon, il n'y avait pas grand chose qui me retenait au lycée.\n(Pendant toute ma scolarité jusqu'ici, je m'étais fait quelques potes et je traînais toujours avec deux amies à moi.\nMais pendant les vacances, en sachant qu'aucune de nous n'allait dans la même fac et qu'on serait éloignées de plusieurs centaines de km, on ne s'est plus beaucoup vues ni parlées…\nEt côté mec, rien de très fameux non plus.\nJe n'ai eu qu'un petit flirt quand j'étais en première. Un gars qui jouait de la guitare. Mais ça n'avait pas abouti à grand-chose…\nAlors la fac est un peu un saut dans l'inconnu pour moi… un nouveau départ.)","next":"s2_9"},"s2_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"pere","text":"La fac, les études…\nÇa passe vite.\nProfite.","next":"s2_10"},"s2_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(C'est probablement la phrase la plus longue qu'il m'ait dite cette semaine.)","next":"s3_1"},"s3_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","background":"assets/Décors/Entrée campus.png","text":"{playerName} ?\nEh oh {playerName} ! On est arrivés marmotte !","next":"s3_2"},"s3_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Hein ? Quoi ?\n(J'ouvre soudain les yeux en sursautant à moitié. Je suis dans la voiture, le moteur est coupé. Mon père est en train de sortir tous mes bagages du coffre. Et ma mère me secoue à l'arrière de la voiture pour que je daigne me réveiller.)","next":"s3_3"},"s3_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Eh ben, j'en connais une qui a fait un gros dodo.\nAller, il va te falloir de l'énergie, ta nouvelle vie t'attend.\nOn est à l'entrée du campus.","next":"s3_4"},"s3_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je sors alors de la voiture et je m'étire de tout mon long pour me réveiller. Puis mon regard se pose sur l'immense entrée du campus et tous les étudiants qui débarquent.)\nWow, y'en a du monde !","next":"s3_5"},"s3_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"pere","text":"Tiens, je t'ai tout sorti du coffre.","next":"s3_6"},"s3_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Ça va aller pour porter tout ça ? Tu veux qu'on t'accompagne jusqu'à ta chambre ?","next":"s3_7"},"s3_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Euh… non merci, ça va aller.","next":"s3_8"},"s3_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"mere","text":"Ok. Bon aller, viens là.\n(Elle s'est approchée pour me faire un câlin, pendant que mon père referme le coffre de la voiture.)\nTu vas nous manquer !","next":"s3_9"},"s3_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"pere","text":"Tiens, au cas où.\n(Il me tend une petite enveloppe. Je l'ouvre et y découvre 50€ à l'intérieur. C'est sa façon à lui de dire qu'il pense à moi…)","next":"s3_10"},"s3_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Merci papa, c'est gentil.\nAller j'y vais, je vous appelle demain ! Bisous.","next":"s3_11"},"s3_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Tandis que la voiture de mes parents s'éloigne, je prends une grande inspiration. J'attrape tous mes bagages et je commence à avancer pour entrer dans le campus.)\nPunaise, c'est lourd !","next":"s4_1"},"s4_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","background":"assets/Décors/Cour Campus.jpg","text":"(Bon… cette fois, je suis vraiment toute seule. Aller, on charge la batterie sociale à fond, et on se motive. Je lève les yeux vers le campus : il est magnifique. Et… énorme !)","next":"s4_2"},"s4_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Alors que j'avançais, ma valise se bloque d'un coup entre deux pavés de l'immense cour. Elle me glisse alors de la main et tombe au sol.)\nÉvidemment, fallait que ça m'arrive !\n(Plusieurs étudiants passent à côté de moi en continuant de marcher. Certains observent la scène d'un air curieux, d'autres discutent… L'ambiance est vivante, bruyante. J'ai les bras tellement chargés qu'il m'est impossible de me baisser pour ramasser ma pauvre valise. Soudain, une voix calme derrière moi me parvient.)","next":"s4_3"},"s4_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","portrait":"default","text":"Première année ?","next":"s4_4"},"s4_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je me retourne alors et j'aperçois un homme qui semble s'adresser à moi. Je remarque tout de suite qu'il porte un badge autour du cou et qu'il a des feuilles dans la main. Son regard est calme, comme sa voix. Puis il s'approche et attrape la poignée de ma valise au sol pour la relever.)\nEuh… Oui, e-et merci beaucoup.","next":"s4_5"},"s4_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","portrait":"default","text":"Les pavés sont neufs. Ils accrochent les roulettes.\nTu n'es pas la première à qui ça arrive.\n(Il me fait un sourire léger, puis continue)\nLiam. Je fais partie de l'équipe d'accueil des premières années.","cg":"assets/Illustrations/Épisode 1/Illustration 1 - Liam.png","next":"s4_choice1"},"s4_choice1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","options":[{"text":"Enchantée. Je te remercie pour le sauvetage.","effects":{"liam":{"amour":5}},"next":"s4_7a"},{"text":"Salut ! Merci, j'aurais fini par y arriver tu sais…","effects":{"liam":{"amour":0}},"next":"s4_7b"},{"text":"Enchantée ! Merci. Tu dois avoir du boulot si tu fais ça avec tous les nouveaux ?","effects":{"liam":{"amour":-5}},"next":"s4_7c"}]},"s4_7a":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Je t'en prie, c'est mon rôle. Je vais porter ta valise, tu sembles chargée. Suis-moi.","next":"s4_9"},"s4_7b":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"(Il me regarde quelques secondes…)\nJe n'en doute pas. C'est bon, tu vas pouvoir porter tout ça ?","next":"s4_8b"},"s4_8b":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui, ça va le faire. Merci encore.","next":"s4_8b2"},"s4_8b2":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Bon, suis moi.","next":"s4_9"},"s4_7c":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"C'est mon rôle, donc oui. J'aimerais éviter qu'un étudiant se casse la figure la veille de la rentrée. C'est bon, tu vas pouvoir porter tout ça ?","next":"s4_8c"},"s4_8c":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui, ça va le faire. Merci encore.","next":"s4_8c2"},"s4_8c2":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Bon, suis moi.","next":"s4_9"},"s4_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Sans dire un mot, je m'exécute et lui emboîte le pas. Je jette discrètement un œil à son badge. On dirait presque un prof…)","next":"s4_10"},"s4_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Je suis un étudiant, je te rassure.","next":"s4_11"},"s4_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Sa voix m'a fait sursauter. Je ne pensais pas qu'il avait remarqué que je regardais son badge…)\nAh, pardon… Je pensais…","next":"s4_12"},"s4_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Je sais. Je suis en deuxième année ici.","next":"s4_13"},"s4_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Il lit dans les pensées ou quoi ? Et on va où comme ça ? Quelques instants plus tard, on arrive devant un panneau. Ça semble être un plan du campus. Liam commence à me désigner les bâtiments.)","next":"s4_14"},"s4_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Donc, ici, à droite, les chambres du campus. Là-bas au milieu, les amphithéâtres.\nLa bibliothèque est dans le bâtiment des amphis. Elle reste ouverte jusqu'à vingt-deux heures.\nLe bâtiment de communication est au fond.\n(Il marque une pause.)\nTu finiras par connaître le campus par cœur. Au début… tout le monde s'y perd.","next":"s4_15"},"s4_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je regarde le plan, un peu perdue)","next":"s4_16"},"s4_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Tu n'as rien retenu, hein ?","next":"s4_17"},"s4_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Euh.. si si ! (je me mets à rougir honteusement)\nEnfin… presque !","next":"s4_18"},"s4_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Liam laisse échapper un léger rire)","next":"s4_19"},"s4_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"On continue, je vais te montrer les dortoirs et te donner ton numéro de chambre.","next":"s5_1"},"s5_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","background":"assets/Décors/Couloir chambres campus.png","text":"(Nous voilà arrivés dans ce qui semblent être les chambres du campus. J'ai hâte de découvrir ma chambre.)","next":"s5_2"},"s5_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Dis, Liam…\nPourquoi tu fais ça ?","next":"s5_3"},"s5_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Accueillir les nouveaux ?","next":"s5_4"},"s5_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ben… ouais. Tu pourrais profiter de ton dernier jour de vacances à la place.","next":"s5_choice1"},"s5_choice1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","options":[{"text":"Tu as l'air d'aimer aider les gens.","effects":{"liam":{"amour":5}},"next":"s5_5a"},{"text":"Les professeurs te l'ont demandé ?","effects":{"liam":{"amour":0}},"next":"s5_5b"},{"text":"Tu n'as pas l'air très… Enthousiaste ?","effects":{"liam":{"amour":-5}},"next":"s5_5c"}]},"s5_5a":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"J'aime surtout éviter que quelqu'un se sente perdu.\nJe sais ce que ça fait.","next":"s5_6a"},"s5_6a":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Il semble regretter d'en avoir trop dit et change de sujet)","next":"s5_7a"},"s5_7a":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Ta chambre est juste là.","next":"s5_8a"},"s5_8a":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(...qu'est-ce qu'il voulait dire par là ?)","next":"s5_merge"},"s5_5b":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Non. Ils me l'ont proposé. J'ai accepté.","next":"s5_6b"},"s5_6b":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Pourquoi toi ?","next":"s5_7b"},"s5_7b":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Parce que j'étais disponible.","next":"s5_8b"},"s5_8b":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Ok… plus vague, tu meurs)","next":"s5_9b"},"s5_9b":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Ta chambre est juste là.","next":"s5_merge"},"s5_5c":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Il s'arrête quelques secondes et me regarde, impassible)","next":"s5_6c"},"s5_6c":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Je souris rarement. Ça ne veut pas dire que je n'ai pas envie d'être ici.\nÉvite de juger les gens trop vite.","next":"s5_7c"},"s5_7c":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Aïe…)","next":"s5_8c"},"s5_8c":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Ta chambre est juste là.","next":"s5_merge"},"s5_merge":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Chambre C214.\nTa colocataire n'est pas encore arrivée. Les draps sont déjà fournis.\nEt…\n(Il hésite une fraction de seconde.)\nSi tu as un problème… Passe au bureau d'accueil. Ou demande si je suis là.","next":"s5_next2"},"s5_next2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Attends, Liam !","next":"s5_next3"},"s5_next3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Il se retourne et me regarde d'un air interrogateur)\nMerci.\n(Il incline simplement la tête.)","next":"s5_next5"},"s5_next5":{"type":"line","speaker":"liam","text":"Bonne installation.","next":"s5_next6"},"s5_next6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Il est reparti. Il est… Bizarre. Mais dans le bon sens du terme.)","next":"s6_1"},"s6_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","background":"assets/Décors/Chambre sucrette campus.png","text":"(Bon… Me voilà arrivée dans ma chambre. Je pose enfin toutes mes affaires dans la pièce, et je prends un instant pour souffler et regarder autour de moi.)\nC'est pas si mal. J'imaginais ça plus petit !\n(Premier arrivé, premier servi : je peux choisir quel côté je prends ! Ce sera le côté droit. Je commence alors à déballer quelques affaires. Dans ma valise, je trouve ma peluche qui me suit depuis que je suis née. Je m'empresse de la cacher sous les draps de mon lit.)","next":"s6_2"},"s6_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Non… Il me fait de la peine, il peut plus respirer là.\n(Je le glisse alors de sorte à ce que seulement sa tête dépasse légèrement de ma couette.)\nOk, là c'est pas mal, il reste un peu caché comme ça.\n(Je range ensuite quelques vêtements dans l'armoire de mon côté, une photo de mes parents et mon ordinateur sur mon bureau.)\nBon, je commence à me sentir un peu plus \"chez moi\".","next":"s6_4"},"s6_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(D'un coup, j'entends quelqu'un frapper à la porte. Je m'avance pour l'ouvrir. Voilà qu'une grosse valise passe le seuil de la porte. Puis une deuxième. Puis… Une fille aux cheveux noirs, habillée tout en noir.)\nOk… Bonjour ?","next":"s6_6"},"s6_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","portrait":"default","text":"Salut ! Désolé je t'envahis avec mes valises ! Tu dois être ma coloc ? Moi c'est Léonie !","next":"s6_7"},"s6_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Salut ! Enchantée alors, moi c'est {playerName}.\n(Elle essaie d'entrer, mais la deuxième valise reste coincée dans l'encadrement de la porte. Elle tente de tirer dessus, de la pousser, mais la valise ne bouge pas. Elle regarde la valise, puis moi, et marque un silence.)","next":"s6_9"},"s6_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"…Je fais une super première impression.","next":"s6_choice1"},"s6_choice1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","options":[{"text":"Attends, je vais essayer de t'aider.","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":5}},"next":"s6_10a"},{"text":"Je ne sais pas trop comment t'aider là…","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":-5}},"next":"s6_10b"},{"text":"Tu veux que je démonte la porte ?","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":0}},"next":"s6_10c"}]},"s6_10a":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Je vais attraper la poignée de la valise, je vais tirer et toi tu pousses, ok ?","next":"s6_11a"},"s6_11a":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Ok, 3, 2, 1, GO !","next":"s6_12a"},"s6_12a":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(La valise est entrée d'un coup dans la chambre.)","next":"s6_13a"},"s6_13a":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Ah, merci ! J'étais à deux doigts d'abandonner toutes mes affaires dans le couloir.","next":"s6_merge2"},"s6_10b":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Après plusieurs essais de Léonie, la valise passe. Elle laisse échapper un soupir d'épuisement et de soulagement à la fois.)","next":"s6_11b"},"s6_11b":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Bon. Je vais faire comme si tout ça n'était jamais arrivé.","next":"s6_merge2"},"s6_10c":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"(Léonie éclate de rire)\nAh ! Enfin quelqu'un qui a de l'humour. Mais j'arrive toujours pas à la décoincer.","next":"s6_12c"},"s6_12c":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Après plusieurs essais de Léonie, la valise passe. Elle laisse échapper un soupir d'épuisement et de soulagement à la fois.)","next":"s6_merge2"},"s6_merge2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Léonie commence à sortir ses affaires : elle pose un énorme sac rempli de bijoux, puis un autre rempli de livres. Puis… Une peluche en forme de chauve-souris. Je la regarde.)","next":"s6_13"},"s6_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Quoi ? Elle est adorable. Je te juge pas si toi t'as un nounours.","next":"s6_14"},"s6_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je baisse discrètement les yeux vers ma propre peluche que j'ai honteusement bordée tout à l'heure… Comment elle a deviné ?)","next":"s6_15"},"s6_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Première année aussi ?","next":"s6_16"},"s6_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Yes.","next":"s6_17"},"s6_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Communication ?","next":"s6_18"},"s6_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui.","next":"s6_19"},"s6_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Oh. On est dans la même promo alors.","next":"s6_20"},"s6_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Cool ! (...Première bonne nouvelle de la journée !)\n(Soudain, je vois le regard de Léonie se diriger vers un coin du plafond. Son sourire disparaît d'un coup.)","next":"s6_21"},"s6_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Attends. Non.\nNon non non.","next":"s6_22"},"s6_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Intriguée, je suis son regard et tente de comprendre ce qui lui arrive. Une minuscule araignée. À peine visible… Léonie pousse un cri, complètement paniquée, et monte instantanément sur mon lit.)","next":"s6_22b"},"s6_22b":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"ELLE BOUGE !!","next":"s6_23"},"s6_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Elle fait littéralement la taille d'un grain de riz…)","next":"s6_choice2"},"s6_choice2":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","options":[{"text":"Attends, bouge pas, je vais la mettre dehors.","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":5}},"next":"s6_24a"},{"text":"Je crois qu'elle t'a choisie comme coloc.","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":0}},"next":"s6_24b"},{"text":"(Elle est petite mais je n'aime pas trop les araignées non plus…) Bouge pas, je vais essayer de trouver quelqu'un !","effects":{"leonie":{"amitie":-5}},"next":"s6_24c"}]},"s6_24a":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je monte alors sur le lit de Léonie en attrapant un verre et une feuille de papier au passage. J'attrape doucement la minuscule araignée et la fait sortir par la fenêtre.)","next":"s6_25"},"s6_24b":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Ah bah non merci ! Je t'en supplie, tu veux bien la mettre vite dehors ?\n(Je monte alors sur le lit de Léonie en attrapant un verre et une feuille de papier au passage. J'attrape doucement la minuscule araignée et la fait sortir par la fenêtre.)","next":"s6_25"},"s6_24c":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je fonce alors dans le couloir en espérant trouver quelqu'un)\nS'il vous plaît, il y a quelqu'un ??\n(Personne ne répond… Toutes les portes des autres chambres sont fermées…)","next":"s6_24c2"},"s6_24c2":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Viiite je t'en supplie, s'il n'y a personne, tu crois que tu pourrais la mettre dehors ?","next":"s6_24c3"},"s6_24c3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Après tout, elle est vraiment minuscule… Je reviens alors dans la chambre et je monte sur le lit de Léonie en attrapant un verre et une feuille de papier au passage. J'attrape doucement la minuscule araignée et la fait sortir par la fenêtre.)","next":"s6_25"},"s6_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"(Léonie descend alors de mon lit et s'adresse à moi, soulagée)\nTu m'as sauvé la vie ! Je sais qu'elle était toute petite… mais merci.\nJe suis terriblement arachnophobe, je déteste ça !","next":"s6_26"},"s6_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui j'ai cru comprendre… (en repensant à sa réaction de panique, je ne peux pas m'empêcher de commencer à rigoler. Léonie me jette sa peluche chauve-souris dessus)","next":"s6_27"},"s6_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Eh !! C'est pas drôle.\n(elle marque un petit silence, puis se met à rire à son tour)","next":"s6_28"},"s6_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(On se connait depuis quelques minutes, mais j'ai l'impression qu'on va super bien s'entendre !)\n(Au même moment, ma sonnerie de téléphone retentit. 3 secondes plus tard, le téléphone de Léonie vibre à son tour.)\nC'est un message du campus. Apparemment il y a une soirée d'intégration ce soir dans la cour du campus pour les premières années.","next":"s6_29"},"s6_29":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Ça te dit ?","next":"s6_30"},"s6_30":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(J'imagine que ce sera moins intimidant si j'y vais avec ma nouvelle colocataire !)\nCarrément !","next":"s6_31"},"s6_31":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Hiiii trop bien ! Faut qu'on se prépare !","next":"s6_32"},"s6_32":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Attends... on a combien de temps ?","next":"s6_33"},"s6_33":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Suffisamment pour paniquer devant nos placards.","next":"s6_34"},"s6_34":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ah, parfait. Je suis très forte pour ça.\n(Léonie éclate de rire.)","next":"s6_35"},"s6_35":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Allez, debout !\n(Elle se dirige déjà vers son armoire.)","next":"s6_36"},"s6_36":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Je crois que je viens officiellement de me faire une nouvelle amie. Et quelque part, ça me rassure. Je ne sais pas encore ce qui m'attend ce soir... Mais au moins, je ne serai pas toute seule pour le découvrir.)","next":"s6_37"},"s6_37":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Vite ! Je veux être prête avant tout le monde !","next":"s6_38"},"s6_38":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Du calme ! C'est une soirée d'intégration, pas un défilé !","next":"s6_39"},"s6_39":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Justement. On ne sait jamais qui on peut rencontrer…","next":"s6_40"},"s6_40":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(...Elle n'a peut-être pas tort.)","next":"s6_end"},"s6_end":{"type":"end","text":"FIN DE L'ÉPISODE 1","nextEpisode":"episode2"}}}$json$::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, status = excluded.status, data = excluded.data;
insert into episodes (id, title, status, data) values ('episode2', 'Épisode 2', 'published', $json${"id":"episode2","title":"Épisode 2","university":"Université Aster","start":"scene_1_dialogue_1","music":"","nodes":{"scene_1_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Nous voilà dans la cour du campus. Elle est décorée de guirlandes lumineuses, une grosse enceinte passe des musiques du moment.\nDes groupes d'étudiants discutent autour du buffet, d'autres jouent au baby-foot ou s'installent déjà sur les bancs en riant.)","next":"scene_1_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","position":"center","music":"Romantique doux","cg":""},"scene_1_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Malgré l'ambiance festive, on sent que tout le monde essaie discrètement de trouver sa place.)","next":"scene_1_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left"},"scene_1_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Léonie ralentit le pas et observe la cour.)","next":"scene_1_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Oh… Je crois qu'on est officiellement des étudiantes.","next":"scene_1_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ouep. Ça fait bizarre.","next":"scene_1_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Respire. Ils sont tous aussi nouveaux que toi.)","next":"scene_1_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Léonie balaie la foule du regard)","next":"scene_1_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Bon... mission numéro une : trouver à boire.","next":"scene_1_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle me montre un grand saladier rempli de boissons.)\n","next":"scene_1_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_1_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Bouge pas, j'en ai pour deux minutes.","next":"scene_2_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_2_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Attends, je peux t’accompa…","next":"scene_2_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_2_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Mais elle est déjà partie en se faufilant entre les étudiants… Elle m'a abandonnée. Ça fait exactement huit secondes que je suis seule et ça me paraît déjà une éternité.)","next":"scene_2_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_2_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Une voix retentit juste derrière moi.)","next":"scene_2_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_2_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Hé !","next":"scene_3_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_3_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Ouf...","next":"scene_3_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_2_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je me retourne. Une fille rousse me fait un grand signe de la main tout en essayant d'empêcher deux gobelets de lui échapper. Elle finit par en rattraper un au dernier moment.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_3_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle lève les yeux vers moi avec un immense sourire.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Toi, je te connais pas !","next":"scene_3_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui, c'est... plutôt normal ?","next":"scene_3_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Exact ! Donc t'es nouvelle !","next":"scene_3_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle me tend un des deux gobelets.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Zoé. Première année. Communication. Toi aussi ?","next":"scene_3_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Exact.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé ouvre de grands yeux.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Je le savais.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Petit silence.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Enfin… Pas du tout. En fait j'ai tenté au hasard.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle a l'air de parler aussi vite qu'elle réfléchit... c'est-à-dire très vite.)","next":"scene_3_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Wow ! Comment tu fais pour parler aussi vite ?","effects":{"zoe":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_3_dialogue_14"},{"text":"Eh ben… Enchantée, Zoé.","effects":{"zoe":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_3_dialogue_16"},{"text":"Salut ! T’abordes toujours les inconnus comme ça ?","effects":{"zoe":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_3_dialogue_17"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé réfléchit deux secondes.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_15","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Je sais pas… Je crois que si je ralentis, je m’endors.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Ah ! Enfin quelqu’un de poli !\nDepuis tout à l’heure, je tombe que sur des gens aigris.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé hausse les épaules)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_18","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Ben… Si j’attends qu’ils viennent me parler, on risque d’être diplômées avant.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_19","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(pas faux…)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé attrape doucement mon bras.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_21","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Viens ! Je vais te présenter du monde.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_22","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Tout de suite ?","next":"scene_3_dialogue_23","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Bah oui ! On est là pour ça.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_24","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_24":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Je sens que je n'ai pas vraiment le choix. On traverse alors la cour. Zoé salue pratiquement une personne sur deux.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_25","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Lui c'est Julien. Très sympa. Par contre, ne joue jamais au Kem’s avec lui.\nElle, c'est Emma. Je crois. Ou Élisa. Attends...","next":"scene_3_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle fronce les sourcils.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_27","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Mince. J'ai oublié. C'est terrible.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_28","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Comment elle fait pour parler à autant de monde ?\nElle continue d'avancer parmi la foule.)","next":"scene_3_dialogue_29","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_29":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Lui c'est Max. Très gentil. Il a déjà perdu son badge étudiant.\nEt… Ah ! Lui je connais plus son prénom. Mais il sent beaucoup trop fort le parfum.","next":"scene_3_dialogue_30","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_30":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On arrive finalement devant un baby-foot où deux garçons jouent bruyamment.)\n","next":"scene_3_dialogue_31","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_3_dialogue_31":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(L'un porte une casquette à l'envers, des cheveux violets dépassent de chaque côté. L'autre, métisse, affiche un sourire rayonnant.)","next":"scene_4_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_4_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Impossible ! Tu triches !","next":"scene_4_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"],"cg":"assets/Illustrations/Episode 2/Illustration 1 - Sasha et Mehdi.png"},"scene_4_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Sasha… Ça fait trois buts que tu dis ça.","next":"scene_4_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_4_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Parce que ça fait trois fois que tu triches Mehdi.","next":"scene_4_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_4_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Ou trois fois que tu regardes le buffet au lieu de la balle.","next":"scene_4_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_4_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"C'est de la concentration stratégique.","next":"scene_4_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_4_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Mehdi lève les yeux au ciel en riant. Puis il aperçoit Zoé. Et moi. Son sourire s'élargit immédiatement.)","next":"scene_4_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_4_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"On a des spectatrices ! Vous venez d'arriver ?","next":"scene_5_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_5_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"Je t'amène une nouvelle tête.","next":"scene_5_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["mehdi","zoe"]},"scene_5_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Mehdi. Enchanté.","next":"scene_5_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["mehdi","zoe"]},"scene_5_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(À côté de lui, Sasha lâche les poignées du baby-foot.)","next":"scene_6_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi","zoe"]},"scene_6_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Sasha. Et ne l'écoute pas. C'est moi le plus sympa des deux.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_7_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Tu dis ça à chaque fois.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Parce que c'est vrai.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il me regarde quelques secondes.)","next":"scene_7_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Enfin… Ça dépend des jours.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je souris malgré moi. Ils ont l'air de se connaître depuis une éternité.)","next":"scene_7_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Vous vous connaissez depuis longtemps ?","next":"scene_7_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Depuis le collège. J’ai bien essayé de me débarrasser de lui mais…","next":"scene_7_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Sans succès. Je lui manquais trop.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Ils échangent un regard complice et se mettent à rigoler. Puis Sasha s’adresse à moi.)","next":"scene_7_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Bon, {playerName}. On va voir si t'es quelqu'un de fréquentable.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Rien que ça ?","next":"scene_7_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Imagine, tu manges une pizza. Il reste une dernière part. Mais vous êtes deux. Tu fais quoi ?","next":"scene_7_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Euh… Je la coupe en deux.","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_7_dialogue_13"},{"text":"Euh… Je laisse l’autre choisir.","effects":{},"next":"scene_7_dialogue_15"},{"text":"Euh… Je me jette sur la part avant que l’autre la prenne.","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_7_dialogue_18"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_7_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"C’est probablement ce que je ferais aussi.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_14","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Vous êtes beaucoup trop raisonnables pour moi.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"C’est plutôt généreux. Mais ça peut durer longtemps si l’autre répond pareil.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_16","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Vous allez passer la soirée à vous dire “non, toi.”, “non, toi.”...","next":"scene_7_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je crois qu’ils n’auraient définitivement pas la même façon de gérer la situation…)","next":"scene_7_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Enfin quelqu’un d’honnête !","next":"scene_7_dialogue_19","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"left","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Rappelez-moi de ne jamais manger de pizza avec vous deux.","next":"scene_7_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"right","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_7_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(À ce moment-là, Léonie revient avec deux gobelets. Elle s'arrête net.)","next":"scene_8_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","mehdi"]},"scene_8_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"leonie","text":"Ah bah… Je m'absente deux minutes et tu t'es déjà fait une bande !","next":"scene_8_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_8_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"J'ai surtout été adoptée. (Ou kidnappée)","next":"scene_9_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["leonie"]},"scene_9_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé lève fièrement le pouce.)","next":"scene_9_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_9_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"C'est mon super pouvoir.","next":"scene_10_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_10_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Non, ton super pouvoir, c'est surtout de connaître la vie privée de tout le campus.","next":"scene_11_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_11_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Zoé prend un air faussement vexé.)","next":"scene_11_dialogue_2","background":"","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["zoe"]},"scene_11_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"zoe","text":"C'est faux. Pour l'instant.","next":"scene_12_dialogue_1","background":"","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_12_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Tout le monde se met à rire de ses bêtises. L'ambiance devient instantanément plus légère.)","next":"scene_12_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_12_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Puis… Quelques accords de guitare résonnent un peu plus loin.\nLes conversations autour de moi semblent s'effacer pendant une seconde. Cette mélodie. Je la connais…)","next":"scene_12_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_12_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Un étudiant termine son morceau sous quelques applaudissements.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_13_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il relève la tête et nos regards se croisent. Je vois qu’il fronce légèrement les sourcils et se met à sourire. Il repose sa guitare contre le muret et s'approche tranquillement.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","cg":"assets/Illustrations/Episode 2/Illustration 2 - Camel.png"},"scene_13_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Attends...","next":"scene_13_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il me regarde quelques secondes.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"C'est bien toi... ou j'ai besoin de lunettes ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Camel ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Je savais que j'avais une bonne mémoire. Je m'attendais pas à te recroiser ici. Ça fait quoi… 3 ans depuis le lycée ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Deux je crois ! Je croyais que tu avais déménagé après l’année de première ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il me détaille discrètement.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"C’était le cas. Mais j’ai été admis dans cette fac, j’ai une chambre sur le campus.\n","next":"scene_13_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"On dirait que t'as changé.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ah bon ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ouais. Mais en bien.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Il est toujours aussi charmeur. Toujours cette façon de parler sans qu'on sache s'il plaisante ou pas..)","next":"scene_13_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Je ne t’imaginais pas faire tes études ici.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_13_dialogue_14"},{"text":"T’as changé aussi… Enfin, surtout tes cheveux.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_13_dialogue_18"},{"text":"En tout cas, toi t’as toujours une guitare à la main.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_13_dialogue_22"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_13_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il hoche doucement la tête)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_15","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ouais… moi non plus à la base.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_16","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"(Sur un ton taquin) faut dire que t’as jamais été une lumière…","next":"scene_13_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ça explique sûrement pourquoi tu faisais toujours tes devoirs avec moi…","next":"scene_13_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel passe une main dans ses cheveux)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_19","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Merci. Je passe beaucoup trop de temps à essayer de me coiffer.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Qui t’a dit que c’était un compliment ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_21","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"J’te connais, je sais que t’aimes bien dire le contraire de ce que tu penses.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il jette un œil à sa fidèle guitare.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_23","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ça… Je crois que c’est incurable.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_24","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_24":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Malheureusement pour mes oreilles et celles des étudiants…","next":"scene_13_dialogue_25","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"J’attends encore les plaintes officielles.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il reprend son sérieux)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_27","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Tu sais… J'me suis souvent demandé ce que t'étais devenue.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_28","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ah oui ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_29","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_29":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Bah ouais. Tu crois quand même pas que j'ai oublié la fille que je battais au Uno à chaque pause ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_30","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_30":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Parce que tu trichais.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_31","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_31":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"T’as pas de preuve.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_32","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_32":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Tu cachais des cartes dans tes manches.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_33","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_33":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ça s'appelle de la stratégie.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_34","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_34":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je lève les yeux au ciel. Camel me regarde en riant.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_35","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_35":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Tu fais toujours cette tête quand t'es pas convaincue.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_36","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_36":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Quelle tête ?","next":"scene_13_dialogue_37","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_37":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il m'imite avec un air faussement sérieux. Je lui donne un petit coup d'épaule.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_38","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_38":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Arrête.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_39","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_39":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il rit.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_40","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_40":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ah… Je dois avouer que ça m’avait manqué.","next":"scene_13_dialogue_41","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_41":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Pourquoi est-ce que ça me fait sourire ?)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_42","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_42":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(À ce moment-là, une étudiante passe près de nous. Chemise parfaitement repassée, lunettes, un carnet sous le bras.)","next":"scene_13_dialogue_43","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_13_dialogue_43":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle semble traverser la cour sans vraiment prêter attention à la soirée. Camel l'aperçoit.)","next":"scene_14_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Tiens... Victoria.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle s'arrête. Son regard passe brièvement sur Camel, puis sur moi.)","next":"scene_14_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Je ne pensais pas te revoir ici.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Moi non plus.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Vous vous connaissez ?","next":"scene_14_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Nous étions dans le même lycée en terminale.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Enfin... surtout dans le même bâtiment. C'était largement suffisant.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Petit silence. Elle reporte son attention sur moi.)","next":"scene_14_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_14_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Première année ?","next":"scene_14_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Communication ?","next":"scene_14_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"En effet.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Profite de ce soir. Demain après-midi, les illusions commenceront à disparaître.","next":"scene_14_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Top. Merci pour… l’encouragement.","effects":{"victoria":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_14_dialogue_14"},{"text":"Je vais essayer de m’en souvenir.","effects":{"victoria":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_14_dialogue_15"},{"text":"Ça me rassure pas vraiment.","effects":{"victoria":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_14_dialogue_16"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_14_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"C'en était pas un.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Oui, c’est dans ton intérêt.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Ça tombe bien, ce n’était pas le but.","next":"scene_14_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_14_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(A peine sa phrase terminée, elle reprend son chemin sans même nous regarder.)","next":"scene_15_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_15_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Fais pas attention. Elle donne souvent l'impression de passer un entretien d'embauche.","next":"scene_15_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_15_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Vous étiez proches ?","next":"scene_15_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_15_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Pas vraiment. On s'est surtout croisés pendant un an.","next":"scene_15_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_15_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Soudain, une annonce retentit dans un micro.)","next":"scene_15_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_15_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*Bonsoir à tous les nouveaux ! Je fais partie de l’équipe d’orga de cette soirée d’inté. Vous êtes là pour faire connaissance, donc vous êtes tous attendus devant la scène pour un premier petit jeu.*","next":"scene_15_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_15_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On se rapproche alors tous de la petite scène au milieu de la cour. Cinq minutes plus tard, l'animateur tape deux fois dans son micro.)","next":"scene_15_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_15_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*Ooooh ! Je vous sens un peu timides ! Ça tombe bien. On est là pour régler ce problème.\nOn vous a préparé deux mini jeux ce soir. On vous explique le premier.*","next":"scene_15_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_15_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*Très simple : vous allez choisir un binôme.\nVous devrez répondre ensemble à une série de 3 cartes avec chacune une question à laquelle chacun doit répondre.*","next":"scene_15_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_15_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"Le but ? Découvrir votre partenaire... sans mentir, évidemment. Vous avez 15 minutes !","next":"scene_16_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":[]},"scene_16_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Bon… Je crois qu'il faut vite que je choisisse un binôme avant de me retrouver seule. Je prends mon courage à deux mains et je fonce.)","next":"scene_16_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","camel","mehdi"]},"scene_16_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Mehdi, tu veux qu'on fasse équipe ?","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_17_dialogue_1"},{"text":"Sasha, on se met ensemble ?","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_18_dialogue_1"},{"text":"Camel, tu veux vérifier si on se connaît toujours aussi bien ?","effects":{"camel":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_19_dialogue_1"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha","camel","mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Avec plaisir !","next":"scene_17_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On s’installe à une petite table après avoir récupéré trois cartes. Le jeu commence.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Tu veux commencer ?","next":"scene_17_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"D’accord, c’est parti !\nPremière question : “quel est ton plus gros défaut ?”","next":"scene_17_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Je réfléchis beaucoup trop.\nParfois, je passe tellement de temps à peser le pour et le contre... que quelqu'un finit par décider à ma place.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"À ton tour.","next":"scene_17_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Je manque un peu de confiance en moi","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_17_dialogue_7"},{"text":"Je suis trop pessimiste.","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_17_dialogue_9"},{"text":"Je suis un peu têtue.","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_17_dialogue_8"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"T’inquiète, je crois qu’on est plus nombreux que tu le penses à être comme ça.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Après, si c’est pour défendre ce qui compte, c’est pas forcément un défaut.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Ça, c’est dommage. Il faut savoir prendre la vie du bon côté !","next":"scene_17_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je pioche une deuxième carte.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"“Quelle est la qualité que tu admires le plus chez quelqu'un ?”","next":"scene_17_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Les gens qui restent eux-mêmes. Même quand ils veulent faire bonne impression.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je souris... C'est une jolie réponse.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_14","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"T'as toujours une réponse toute prête ?","next":"scene_17_dialogue_15","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Ahah, non. Mais celle-là, j'y avais déjà réfléchi. À ton tour.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_16","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"J’admire les gens très sociables. J’aimerais beaucoup l’être davantage.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Et bien regarde, c’est ton premier jour sur le campus, et tu joues à ce jeu avec un quasi-inconnu. T’es sur la bonne voie !","next":"scene_17_dialogue_18","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Sa réponse me fait plaisir. Je lui souris timidement.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_19","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Dernière carte. “Décris ton partenaire en un seul mot.”","next":"scene_17_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Mehdi réfléchit quelques secondes.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_21","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Je dirai… curieuse.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_22","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Pourquoi ?","next":"scene_17_dialogue_23","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Depuis tout à l'heure… Tu regardes tout. Les gens, les bâtiments, même les affiches partout.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_24","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_24":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Comme si t'avais peur de rater quelque chose.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_25","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Il est vraiment observateur.)","next":"scene_17_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Je te retourne la question.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_27","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Du coup, je dirai que tu es observateur.","next":"scene_17_dialogue_28","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_17_dialogue_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Ahah, c’est bien vu.","next":"scene_20_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_18_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Oula ! Ça va trop vite entre nous {PlayerName}.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je rigole malgré moi. Il me met un léger coup d’épaule et poursuit)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Désolé, pas ma meilleure vanne mais j’étais obligé. Aller viens, on va prendre les cartes et commencer.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On s’installe à une petite table après avoir récupéré trois cartes. Le jeu commence.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Honneur aux dames, commence.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ok, première question : “quel est le talent le plus inutile que tu possèdes ?”","next":"scene_18_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Je reconnais une chanson en trois secondes. Même les musiques de pub. Impressionnant, non ?","next":"scene_18_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Mhhh, c’est pas mal en effet.","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_18_dialogue_8"},{"text":"C’est un peu inquiétant, surtout.","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_18_dialogue_10"},{"text":"N’importe quelle musique ? Impossible, je te crois pas.","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_18_dialogue_11"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_18_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Pas mal ? Mhhh. Ok, je prends.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Sasha éclate de rire)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Ouais je sais. Mais attends, c’est un vrai talent, je suis hyper utile en blindtest.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Sasha pose dramatiquement une main sur son coeur)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Tu doutes de mon talent ? Tu viens de me briser le cœur {PlayerName}.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"À toi de répondre maintenant. T’y échapperas pas.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_14","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je réfléchis quelques secondes.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_15","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Je pense que je suis très forte pour retrouver les objets perdus.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_16","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Je t’embauche. Moi je suis très fort pour les perdre. On ferait une bonne équipe.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_17","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Aller, on enchaîne, c’est quoi la prochaine question ?","next":"scene_18_dialogue_18","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je retourne la deuxième carte.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_19","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"\"Quelle est la chose la plus ridicule que tu aies faite ?\"","next":"scene_18_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Sasha réfléchit.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_21","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"...J'ai voulu impressionner une fille en faisant du skate au lycée. Je suis tombé avant même de monter dessus.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_22","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je ne peux pas m'empêcher de rire.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_23","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Vraiment ?","next":"scene_18_dialogue_24","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_24":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Du coup la fille est partie et m’a plus jamais parlé.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_25","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Et toi ? La chose la plus ridicule que t’aies faite ?","next":"scene_18_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Pas plus tard qu’hier, j’ai voulu ouvrir la portière de ma voiture… Sauf que c’était pas la mienne. Et le propriétaire de la voiture me regardait.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_27","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il éclate de rire.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_28","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Donc t’as failli voler une voiture sans faire exprès ? ","next":"scene_18_dialogue_29","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_29":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"J’ai surtout découvert que le sol pouvait devenir très intéressant à regarder. C’était… embarrassant. Très embarrassant.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_30","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_30":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Bon, dernière question : “à quoi te fait penser ton binôme ?”","next":"scene_18_dialogue_31","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_31":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"À un chat.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_32","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_32":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je le regarde, surprise.)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_33","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_33":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Un chat ?","next":"scene_18_dialogue_34","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_34":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Ouais. Au début ça observe. Ça juge un peu. Puis quand il décide de s’approcher… C’est que t’as réussi le test.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_35","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_35":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je souris timidement. C’était un compliment ça… ?)","next":"scene_18_dialogue_36","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_36":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Et moi, je te fais penser à quoi ?","next":"scene_18_dialogue_37","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_37":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Et bien tu m’as tout l’air d’être un petit clown.","next":"scene_18_dialogue_38","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_18_dialogue_38":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"C’est les cheveux violets qui font cet effet là.","next":"scene_20_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_19_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Chaud. Viens, on va récupérer les cartes pour jouer.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On s’installe à une petite table après avoir récupéré trois cartes. Le jeu commence. Je retourne la première carte.)","next":"scene_19_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Alors, première question : \"Quelle chanson te décrit le mieux ?\"","next":"scene_19_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Comme par hasard, une question sur la musique.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Je dirais… Une chanson qui va un peu crescendo… Genre Iris des Goo Goo Dolls.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ouais. De la guitare acoustique. Jusqu’ici ça te ressemble assez bien.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Je prends ça pour un compliment.\nEt toi ?","next":"scene_19_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"C’est difficile comme question. Laisse moi réfléchir…","next":"scene_19_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Peut-être… Riptide de Vance Joy.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"T’as réfléchi longtemps.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Parce que je connais beaucoup de musiques. Non pas parce que je ne me connais pas parfaitement…","next":"scene_19_dialogue_12","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_12":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Bref, deuxième question. \"Qui de vous deux est le plus têtu ?\"","next":"scene_19_dialogue_13","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_13":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel me regarde.)","next":"scene_19_dialogue_14","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_14":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Toi.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_15","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_15":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Pardon ?","next":"scene_19_dialogue_16","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_16":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Tu fais cette tête quand tu sais que j'ai raison.","next":"scene_19_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"C’est clairement toi le plus têtu. ","effects":{"camel":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_19_dialogue_17"},{"text":"On est peut-être tous les deux un peu trop têtus.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_19_dialogue_18"},{"text":"Je fais cette tête quand je suis convaincue d’avoir raison.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_19_dialogue_19"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_19_dialogue_17":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Mauvaise foi détectée.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_18":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ça se défend. 1 partout pour cette fois.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_19":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Donc tout le temps. C’est bien toi la plus têtue.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_20","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_20":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je l’ignore et je retourne la dernière carte.)","next":"scene_19_dialogue_21","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_21":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"\"Décris ton partenaire en un seul mot.\"","next":"scene_19_dialogue_22","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_22":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel réfléchit longuement. Puis sourit.)","next":"scene_19_dialogue_23","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_23":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Inattendue.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_24","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_24":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Inattendue ?","next":"scene_19_dialogue_25","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_25":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ouais. Parce qu'à chaque fois que je crois savoir ce que tu vas répondre… Tu me surprends.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_26","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_26":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Petit silence. J’essaie de retenir un petit sourire.)","next":"scene_19_dialogue_27","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_27":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Pour toi, je dirais… Tchatcheur.","next":"scene_19_dialogue_28","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_19_dialogue_28":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Alors là ! Je vois pas de quoi tu parles. J’ai juste de la répartie.","next":"scene_20_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_20_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*Merci tout le monde !*\n(Quelques applaudissements retentissent. Les étudiants commencent à se disperser de nouveau dans la cour.)","next":"scene_20_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_20_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je ne pensais pas rencontrer autant de monde dès le premier soir. Et pourtant... j'ai déjà l'impression que cette année risque d'être bien différente de tout ce que j'ai connu jusque-là.)","next":"scene_20_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_20_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*On enchaîne avec le deuxième et dernier jeu ! Cette fois, on complique un peu les choses.\nVous allez partir par équipes de trois. Vous devez retrouver trois jetons cachés sur le campus grâce à des énigmes.*","next":"scene_20_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_20_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*L'équipe gagnante remportera trois places de cinéma !*","next":"scene_21_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_21_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Ah ! Ça, ça vaut le coup.","next":"scene_21_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_21_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"mehdi","text":"Sasha, tu regardes même pas le film quand tu vas au cinéma…","next":"scene_21_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["mehdi"]},"scene_21_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"sasha","text":"Ouais. Mais j'adore le pop-corn.","next":"scene_22_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["sasha"]},"scene_22_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*Les équipes sont déjà faites ! La liste des équipes est affichée un peu partout dans la cour, je vous laisse en prendre connaissance.*","next":"scene_22_dialogue_2","background":"","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_22_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Je m’avance vers la première liste que je vois et je cherche mon nom parmi les 200 nouveaux étudiants… Bingo ! Je suis avec…)","next":"scene_22_choix_1","background":"","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_22_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Camel et Victoria (je choisis cette équipe)","effects":{"camel":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_23_dialogue_1"},{"text":"Mehdi et Léonie (je choisis cette équipe)","effects":{"mehdi":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_23_dialogue_1"},{"text":"Sasha et Zoé (je choisis cette équipe)","effects":{"sasha":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_23_dialogue_1"}],"background":"","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_23_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Nous nous sommes tous les trois retrouvés devant la scène pour récupérer les 3 énigmes.)","next":"scene_23_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_23_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ok, c’est parti. Je lis la première énigme.","next":"scene_23_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"\"Je suis l’endroit où les étudiants viennent dormir les yeux ouverts.\"\nDonc… Le cours de 8h ?","next":"scene_23_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Victoria soupire)","next":"scene_23_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"L’amphithéâtre. On y va.","next":"scene_23_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"T’es vraiment pas drôle.","next":"scene_23_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Et pourtant, on avance.","next":"scene_23_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_23_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Ils ont l’air d’avoir l’habitude de se lancer des piques…)","next":"scene_24_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_24_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Pendant qu’on marche, Camel me regarde.)","next":"scene_24_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_24_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Au fait… Tu pensais que j’étais devenu quoi ? Rockstar ?","next":"scene_24_choix_1","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_choix_1":{"type":"choice","speaker":"moi","text":"","options":[{"text":"Peut-être bien ouais, ça aurait pu bien t’aller.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":0}},"next":"scene_24_dialogue_3"},{"text":"Plutôt guitariste dans le métro.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":-5}},"next":"scene_24_dialogue_3"},{"text":"J’avoue que je me suis déjà posé la question.","effects":{"camel":{"amour":5}},"next":"scene_24_dialogue_3"}],"background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_24_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"J’suis flatté. Malheureusement, j’en suis pas encore là.","next":"scene_24_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Ça viendra, peut-être !","next":"scene_24_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Aïe. Je vais vraiment finir par croire que je joue mal à force.","next":"scene_24_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Sois pas si susceptible.","next":"scene_24_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ah ouais ?","next":"scene_24_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"Oui.","next":"scene_24_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel laisse échapper un petit sourire.)","next":"scene_24_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_24_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Encore une fois, je m’attendais pas à cette réponse.","next":"scene_25_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Hall campus.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Bon, vous avez fini ? J’ai trouvé le premier jeton pendant que vous faisiez vos petites retrouvailles. Ce n’est ni le moment, ni l’endroit. Camel, c’est quoi la deuxième énigme ?","next":"scene_25_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_25_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Ça la tuerait de se détendre un peu celle-là ?)","next":"scene_25_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_25_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel lui lance un regard de défi et s’adresse à elle.)","next":"scene_25_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_25_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Comment s’appelle cette soirée déjà ? Ah oui, une soirée d’INTÉGRATION. Du coup, je crois que c’est bel et bien le moment et l’endroit pour faire nos “petites retrouvailles”.","next":"scene_25_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Wow… Là je le reconnais bien. Il a dit les termes.)","next":"scene_25_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Il a ensuite enchaîné en lisant la deuxième énigme.)","next":"scene_25_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"“Je suis l’endroit où certains prétendent travailler.”","next":"scene_25_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"La bibliothèque.","next":"scene_25_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"T’as répondu un peu trop vite je trouve.","next":"scene_25_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Parce que j’y mets jamais les pieds.","next":"scene_25_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_25_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Ça se voit.","next":"scene_26_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Amphi 1 nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_26_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"J’ai trouvé le deuxième jeton. On a presque fini, tu peux lire la dernière énigme Camel ?","next":"scene_26_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Bibliothèque nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_26_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"À ce rythme là on a carrément nos chances de gagner ! ","next":"scene_26_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Bibliothèque nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_26_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"La dernière énigme c’est “je suis vide le matin, rempli le midi et nettoyé l’après-midi.”","next":"scene_26_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Bibliothèque nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_26_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Celle-là est simple. Vite, on va au réfectoire.","next":"scene_27_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Bibliothèque nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_27_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Ah ah ! Dernier jeton trouvé. C’est bon, on a les 3.","next":"scene_27_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cafétéria campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_27_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"On retourne dans la cour ! J’espère qu’on sera les premiers.","next":"scene_28_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Cafétéria campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel"]},"scene_28_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(On arrive devant la scène. À première vue, il n’y a pas d’autre équipe devant nous.)","next":"scene_28_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center"},"scene_28_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"S’il vous plaît ? On a récupéré les 3 jetons.","next":"scene_28_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"Déjà ? Je crois qu’on a nos gagnants alors !*","next":"scene_28_dialogue_4","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_4":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Il faut dire que vos énigmes n’étaient pas très compliquées…","next":"scene_28_dialogue_5","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_5":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"*L’objectif était surtout de vous faire découvrir le campus et que vous fassiez un peu connaissance.*","next":"scene_28_dialogue_6","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_6":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Camel et moi échangeons un regard complice et moqueur envers Victoria.)","next":"scene_28_dialogue_7","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_7":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(D’un geste naturel, on se check, et il me fait un clin d’oeil discret.)","next":"scene_28_dialogue_8","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_8":{"type":"line","speaker":"camel","text":"Victoria, reconnais que sans nous, tu te serais ennuyée.","next":"scene_28_dialogue_9","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"],"cg":"assets/Illustrations/Episode 2/Illustration 3 - Camel + sucrette.png"},"scene_28_dialogue_9":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(Elle répond sans même tourner la tête.)","next":"scene_28_dialogue_10","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_10":{"type":"line","speaker":"victoria","text":"Sans vous, j'aurais surtout terminé trois minutes plus tôt…","next":"scene_28_dialogue_11","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]},"scene_28_dialogue_11":{"type":"line","speaker":"narration","text":"(...Qu’est-ce qu’elle peut être froide...)","next":"","background":"assets/Décors/Cour campus nuit.png","music":"Romantique doux","position":"center","onScreen":["camel","victoria"]}}}$json$::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, status = excluded.status, data = excluded.data;
insert into episodes (id, title, status, data) values ('episode3', 'Épisode 3', 'draft', $json${"id":"episode3","title":"Épisode 3","university":"Université Aster","start":"scene_1_dialogue_1","music":"","nodes":{"scene_1_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"cc","next":"scene_1_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Salle de TD.jpg","position":"center"},"scene_1_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"isaac","text":"cool","next":"scene_1_dialogue_3","background":"assets/Décors/Salle de TD.jpg","music":"","position":"right","onScreen":["isaac"]},"scene_1_dialogue_3":{"type":"line","speaker":"nathan","text":"sazjkdejza;fbdjca","next":"scene_2_dialogue_1","background":"assets/Décors/Salle de TD.jpg","music":"","position":"center"},"scene_2_dialogue_1":{"type":"line","speaker":"moi","text":"sezddzdedze","next":"scene_2_dialogue_2","background":"assets/Décors/Salle de TD.jpg","music":"","position":"center"},"scene_2_dialogue_2":{"type":"line","speaker":"isaac","text":"","next":"","background":"assets/Décors/Salle de TD.jpg","music":"","position":"center","onScreen":["aaron","camel"]}}}$json$::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, status = excluded.status, data = excluded.data;
